### ============================================================
### CloudPivot API 测试集合
### 基础路径: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
### 使用方式: 在 VS Code 中安装 REST Client 扩展，点击 Send Request
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@token = {{access_token}}

### ============================================================
### 0. 健康检查
### ============================================================

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### 1. 认证模块 (Auth)
### ============================================================

### 1.1 获取验证码 🔓
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/captcha
Accept: application/json

###

### 1.2 用户注册 🔓
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "test123456",
  "display_name": "Test User"
}

###

### 1.3 用户登录 🔓 (获取 access_token 和 refresh_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

###

### 1.4 用户登录 (带验证码) 🔓
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "captcha_id": "replace-with-captcha-id",
  "captcha_code": "replace-with-captcha-code"
}

###

### 1.5 刷新令牌 🔓
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access_token);
  client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

###

### 1.6 用户登出 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 2. 用户管理模块 (Users)
### ============================================================

### 2.1 获取当前用户信息 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 2.2 更新当前用户信息 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Super Admin",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "theme": "dark"
}

###

### 2.3 更新个人通知配置 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notification_email": "admin@cloudpivot.localhost",
  "feishu_webhook": "https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxx",
  "dingtalk_webhook": "https://oapi.dingtalk.com/robot/send?access_token=xxx",
  "notify_channels": "email,feishu"
}

###

### 2.4 修改密码 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "admin123",
  "new_password": "newadmin123"
}

###

### 2.5 获取用户列表 👑
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 2.6 获取用户列表 - 按角色筛选 👑
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=admin&status=active
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 2.7 获取用户列表 - 搜索 👑
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 2.8 创建用户 👑
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "newuser123456",
  "display_name": "New User",
  "role": "viewer",
  "status": "active"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("new_user_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 2.9 获取指定用户详情 👑
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{new_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 2.10 更新指定用户信息 👑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{new_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Updated User",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 2.11 删除用户 👑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{new_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 3. 团队管理模块 (Teams)
### ============================================================

### 3.1 获取团队列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3.2 创建团队 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "运维团队",
  "description": "负责生产环境运维"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("team_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 3.3 获取团队详情 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3.4 更新团队信息 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "运维团队-V2",
  "description": "负责生产与测试环境运维"
}

###

### 3.5 获取团队成员列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3.6 添加团队成员 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "role": "member"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("member_user_id", response.body.user_id);
%}

###

### 3.7 更新成员角色 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 3.8 移除团队成员 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}/members/{{member_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3.9 删除团队 👑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{team_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 4. 主机管理模块 (Hosts)
### ============================================================

### 4.1 获取主机列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.2 获取主机列表 - 按状态筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts?status=online&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.3 获取主机列表 - 按关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts?keyword=web&skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.4 获取主机列表 - 按分组筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts?group_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.5 添加主机 (密码认证) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "web-server-01",
  "hostname": "web01",
  "ip_address": "192.168.1.10",
  "port": 22,
  "auth_type": "password",
  "username": "root",
  "password": "your-ssh-password",
  "description": "Web 前端服务器",
  "public_ip": "1.2.3.4",
  "os_name": "Ubuntu",
  "os_version": "22.04"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("host_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 4.6 添加主机 (密钥认证) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "db-server-01",
  "hostname": "db01",
  "ip_address": "192.168.1.20",
  "port": 22,
  "auth_type": "key",
  "username": "root",
  "private_key": "-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\nreplace-with-your-key\n-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----",
  "description": "数据库服务器"
}

###

### 4.7 批量导入主机 👑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts/batch-import
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hosts": [
    {
      "name": "server-01",
      "hostname": "srv01",
      "ip_address": "192.168.1.30",
      "username": "root",
      "password": "secret"
    },
    {
      "name": "server-02",
      "hostname": "srv02",
      "ip_address": "192.168.1.31",
      "username": "root",
      "auth_type": "key",
      "private_key": "-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 4.8 获取主机详情 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{host_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.9 获取主机监控图表数据 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{host_id}}/metrics?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.10 更新主机信息 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{host_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "web-server-01-updated",
  "description": "Web 前端服务器 (已更新)",
  "port": 2222
}

###

### 4.11 测试主机连通性 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{host_id}}/test
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.12 删除主机 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{host_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.13 获取主机组列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts/groups/list
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.14 创建主机组 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "生产环境",
  "description": "生产环境服务器组",
  "parent_id": null
}

> {%
  client.global.set("group_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 4.15 获取标签列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/hosts/tags/list
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4.16 创建标签 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/hosts/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "生产环境",
  "color": "#e02424"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("tag_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### ============================================================
### 5. WebSSH / 会话模块
### ============================================================

### 5.1 获取会话列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5.2 获取会话命令记录 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/1/commands?skip=0&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5.3 获取会话录屏记录 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/1/recording
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5.4 获取活跃会话列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/active-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5.5 WebSSH WebSocket 连接 (需 WebSocket 客户端测试)
### 连接地址: ws://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/ws/ssh/{{host_id}}?token={{access_token}}
### 消息示例:
###   输入: {"type": "input", "data": "ls -la\n"}
###   调整尺寸: {"type": "resize", "cols": 120, "rows": 40}
###   心跳: {"type": "ping"}

### ============================================================
### 6. 权限控制模块 (Permissions)
### ============================================================

### 6.1 获取权限列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.2 获取权限列表 - 按主机筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions?host_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.3 获取权限列表 - 按团队筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions?team_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.4 获取权限列表 - 按用户筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions?user_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.5 创建权限 (团队授权) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host_id": 1,
  "team_id": 1,
  "permission_level": "read_execute",
  "can_upload": false,
  "can_download": true,
  "can_execute": true,
  "allowed_time_start": "09:00",
  "allowed_time_end": "18:00",
  "allowed_days": "1,2,3,4,5"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("perm_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 6.6 创建权限 (用户授权) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host_id": 1,
  "user_id": 2,
  "permission_level": "readonly",
  "can_upload": false,
  "can_download": false,
  "can_execute": false
}

###

### 6.7 更新权限 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/permissions/{{perm_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission_level": "read_write",
  "can_upload": true,
  "can_download": true,
  "can_execute": true,
  "is_active": true
}

###

### 6.8 删除权限 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/permissions/{{perm_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.9 获取临时授权列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions/temporary
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.10 获取临时授权列表 - 按用户筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/permissions/temporary?user_id=2
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6.11 创建临时授权 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/permissions/temporary
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host_id": 1,
  "user_id": 2,
  "permission_level": "read_execute",
  "reason": "紧急运维需求",
  "expires_at": "2026-05-20T00:00:00Z"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("temp_perm_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 6.12 撤销临时授权 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/permissions/temporary/{{temp_perm_id}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 7. Dashboard 模块
### ============================================================

### 7.1 获取 Dashboard 数据 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 8. 主机监控模块 (Monitor)
### ============================================================

### 8.1 获取主机监控指标 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/metrics/1?hours=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.2 获取主机监控指标 (24小时) 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/metrics/1?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.3 获取主机最新指标 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/metrics/1/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.4 获取告警规则列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.5 创建告警规则 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CPU 过高告警",
  "description": "CPU 使用率超过 90%",
  "metric_type": "cpu_percent",
  "condition": "gt",
  "threshold": 90.0,
  "duration_seconds": 0,
  "severity": "warning",
  "notify_channels": ["email"],
  "is_enabled": true
}

> {%
  client.global.set("rule_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 8.6 创建告警规则 (指定主机) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alert-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "内存告警 - web-server",
  "metric_type": "memory_percent",
  "condition": "gt",
  "threshold": 85.0,
  "severity": "critical",
  "host_id": 1,
  "notify_channels": ["email", "webhook"],
  "webhook_url": "https://hooks.example.com/alert",
  "is_enabled": true
}

###

### 8.7 更新告警规则 🔑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alert-rules/{{rule_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CPU 过高告警 (更新)",
  "threshold": 95.0,
  "severity": "critical",
  "is_enabled": true
}

###

### 8.8 删除告警规则 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alert-rules/{{rule_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.9 获取告警记录列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alerts?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.10 获取告警记录 - 按严重级别筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alerts?severity=critical&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.11 确认告警 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alerts/1/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.12 解决告警 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/alerts/1/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8.13 Agent 上报监控数据 🔓
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitor/agent/report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host_id": 1,
  "cpu_percent": 45.2,
  "memory_percent": 68.1,
  "memory_used_gb": 10.9,
  "memory_total_gb": 16.0,
  "disk_percent": 52.0,
  "disk_used_gb": 104.0,
  "disk_total_gb": 200.0,
  "network_in_kbps": 1024.5,
  "network_out_kbps": 512.3,
  "load_1min": 1.25,
  "load_5min": 1.10,
  "load_15min": 0.95
}

###

### ============================================================
### 9. Docker 管理模块
### ============================================================

### 9.1 获取 Docker 主机列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.2 添加 Docker 主机 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "本地 Docker",
  "host": "unix:///var/run/docker.sock",
  "tls_verify": false
}

> {%
  client.global.set("docker_host_id", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 9.3 添加 Docker 主机 (远程 TCP) 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/hosts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "远程 Docker",
  "host": "tcp://192.168.1.10:2376",
  "host_id": 1,
  "team_id": 1,
  "tls_verify": true,
  "cert_path": "/etc/docker/certs"
}

###

### 9.4 删除 Docker 主机 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/docker/hosts/{{docker_host_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.5 获取容器列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers?all=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.6 获取容器列表 (含已停止) 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers?all=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.7 获取容器详情 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.8 启动容器 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/start
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.9 停止容器 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeout": 10
}

###

### 9.10 重启容器 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeout": 10
}

###

### 9.11 删除容器 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx?force=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.12 获取容器日志 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/logs?tail=100
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.13 获取容器资源统计 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.14 在容器内执行命令 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/containers/nginx/exec
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "ls -la /",
  "tty": true
}

###

### 9.15 获取镜像列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/images
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.16 拉取镜像 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/docker/images/pull?repository=nginx&tag=latest
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.17 删除镜像 🔑
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/docker/images/sha256:abc123?force=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9.18 获取 Docker 系统信息 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/docker/info
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 10. 会话审计模块 (Audit)
### ============================================================

### 10.1 获取会话审计列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/sessions?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.2 获取会话审计列表 - 按用户筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/sessions?user_id=1&skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.3 获取会话审计列表 - 按主机筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/sessions?host_id=1&status=closed
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.4 获取会话审计列表 - 关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/sessions?keyword=192.168
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.5 获取命令审计列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/commands?skip=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.6 获取命令审计列表 - 按风险等级筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/commands?risk_level=danger&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.7 获取命令审计列表 - 按会话筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/commands?session_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.8 获取命令审计列表 - 关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/commands?keyword=rm
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.9 获取登录日志 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/login-logs?skip=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.10 获取登录日志 - 按用户筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/login-logs?user_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.11 获取登录日志 - 关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/login-logs?keyword=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.12 获取风险命令列表 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/risk-commands?skip=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.13 获取风险命令列表 - 关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/risk-commands?keyword=rm
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.14 导出命令审计 (JSON 格式) 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/export/commands?format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.15 导出命令审计 (CSV 格式) 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/export/commands?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.16 导出命令审计 - 按风险等级筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/export/commands?format=json&risk_level=danger
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.17 获取 SSH 登录日志 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs?skip=0&limit=50&hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.18 获取 SSH 登录日志 - 按主机筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs?host_id=1&hours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.19 获取 SSH 登录日志 - 按风险等级筛选 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs?risk_level=danger&is_success=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.20 获取 SSH 登录日志 - 关键词搜索 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs?keyword=root
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.21 SSH 登录日志统计分析 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs/analysis?hours=24
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.22 SSH 登录日志统计分析 - 按主机 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs/analysis?host_id=1&hours=72
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.23 手动触发 SSH 登录日志采集 👑
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs/collect
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10.24 手动触发 SSH 登录日志采集 (指定主机) 👑
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/ssh-login-logs/collect?host_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 11. SFTP 文件管理模块
### ============================================================

### 11.1 列出远程目录文件 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/list?path=/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 11.2 列出远程目录文件 (指定路径) 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/list?path=/home
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 11.3 创建文件夹 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/mkdir
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/home",
  "name": "newdir"
}

###

### 11.4 重命名文件/文件夹 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/rename
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/home/oldname",
  "new_name": "newname"
}

###

### 11.5 移动文件/文件夹 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/move
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source_path": "/home/file.txt",
  "target_path": "/tmp/"
}

###

### 11.6 复制文件/文件夹 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/copy
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source_path": "/home/file.txt",
  "target_path": "/home/backup/"
}

###

### 11.7 删除文件/文件夹 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/home/unwanted.txt"
}

###

### 11.8 下载文件 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/download?path=/home/file.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 11.9 上传文件 🔑
POST {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/upload?path=/home
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello, this is a test file.
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

### 11.10 检查路径是否存在 🔑
GET {{baseUrl}}/sftp/1/exists?path=/home/user
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### ============================================================
### 12. 站点配置模块 (Site Config)
### ============================================================

### 12.1 获取注册开放状态 🔓
GET {{baseUrl}}/site-config/registration-status
Accept: application/json

###

### 12.2 获取所有站点配置 👑
GET {{baseUrl}}/site-config
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 12.3 更新单个站点配置 👑
PUT {{baseUrl}}/site-config/allow_register
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "true",
  "description": "Whether open registration is allowed"
}

###

### 12.4 批量更新站点配置 👑
POST {{baseUrl}}/site-config/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "key": "allow_register",
    "value": "false",
    "description": "关闭注册"
  },
  {
    "key": "site_name",
    "value": "My CloudPivot",
    "description": "站点名称"
  }
]

###
